OL,3,GNEWSAWoman walking dog seriously
OL,4,Ainjured after hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are hunting a driver after a
OL,7,Fwoman was seriously hurt in a
OL,8,Fhit-and-run crash while walking her
OL,9,Fdog.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said the woman, in
OL,12,Fher 60s, was crossing a car park near a
OL,13,Fblock of flats on Colliers Way in
OL,14,FReading when she was struck by a
OL,15,Fdark-coloured vehicle that drove off at
OL,16,Fabout 17:10 GMT on Saturday.
OL,18,FThe force said the woman was still in
OL,19,Fhospital receiving treatment. Her dog,
OL,20,Fa miniature dachshund that ran away
OL,21,Fafter the crash, has since been found
OL,22,Fand safely returned home unharmed.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
